# `git.commit`

Commit staged changes in the caller's worktree.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.git.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `workspace_id` | `string` |
| `message` | `string` |
| `author` | `string` |

## Returns

`JsonResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `json` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call git.commit --json '{ "workspace_id": "", "message": "", "author": "" }'
```

